#. choice
msgctxt "526416"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526604"
msgid "…hey. I said HEY.\nAre you listening to me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527464"
msgid "……!!! #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527908"
msgid "Right?\nDo you really buy into it? That you're the\nonly person who can stop #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529544"
msgid "Yeah, I'm a misunderstood genius, after all!\nI know what I lack, too!\nBut, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529632"
msgid "I'm a Master, regardless!\nI came to the moon to win! I'll cling to\nany chance I get!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529884"
msgid "Huh…? Hu―ah―――Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530108"
msgid "Ah―――Waahh, what is this―――\nMy, body―――body is, melting―――\nWAAAAAAAAHHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530208"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530628"
msgid "…#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's kindness has affected you,\nhasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530696"
msgid "…………!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531308"
msgid "It helps to hear you say that.\nSo, how about we start with a scan?\n………hmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531608"
msgid "What's going on here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531772"
msgid "It could be some sort of trap.\nPlease go in and be wary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531900"
msgid "…huh? Maybe we took a wrong turn?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532232"
msgid "True. It's possible that #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF is\nusing some method to conceal #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532364"
msgid "He's acted in this way on previous floors.\nIt may well be a tactic he's using."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532444"
msgid "If you two can't meet, then forget #C000246204SGs#CDEF…\nIt's as simple as that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532680"
msgid "I don't know of a way.\nSome verification is necessary…\nand the timing couldn't be better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533092"
msgid "They're around here.\nI sense a Master and a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533544"
msgid "So let's catch them, pronto.\nI may end up having to fight that brat,\nbut I'm also hoping for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533940"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF was waiting in the Arena for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534076"
msgid "I've been waiting for you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nAhh―――You're all sweating and wild like\na haggard dog―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534868"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF speaks to me extremely obscenely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535020"
msgid "Perplexed as I am, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF looks at me tenderly, smiling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535164"
msgid "The good and evil of things are decided in\npeople's minds. Real trust cannot be built with\nthe unobservant… but I want to trust you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535448"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF holds out her hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535616"
msgid "She offered it to me with only the words\n\"I want to trust you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537136"
msgid "Great, then I'm not on your radar.\nUnfortunately, I never had the pure,\nsweet girlhood you like so much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537636"
msgid "…………very well. Let's go back, Master\nWe have no time to indulge their\nlover's quarrel―――#C236196003Caster#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537756"
msgid "――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537880"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537916"
msgid "Ah…… *cough*……\nI never… thought you would… kill…\nme…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538248"
msgid "One needs no reason to crush a worm.\nYou humans, simply by being here, are eyesores."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538336"
msgid "…u―guh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538404"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, face flushed,\ntakes in #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's pained face and voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538704"
msgid "I don't need a poison like you.\nNow, this is the end!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538760"
msgid "Ah! Ahhh! Ahhhhhhh!\nKya! AAAHHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539504"
msgid "What did you say…?\nWho do you think you are, child?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540724"
msgid "…it goes without saying.\nWe'll take it from here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540776"
msgid "………………\nDarling, let's hurry.\nWe mustn't stay here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540940"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541628"
msgid "So the wall is gone. The natural result of\ngathering all of #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542800"
msgid "Truuue. All battles mean big damage on #C236196003Casters#CDEF.\nWhen your items run out, so does your life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543020"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nHeed the girl in red's advice well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543084"
msgid "Cautioned by #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I check my equipment."
msgstr ""

